      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "While the color emoji are great and would be preferable for readability to some, if the desire is to keep the chatbox \"understated\", I'd like to suggest at least using a font that is designed to be white on black.  These emojis are \"photo negatives\" and so they are much harder to interpret.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
