      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is solid feedback, and we'd love to do it -- but it is a little more complicated than it seems at first glance.\nBecause of the way fonts work in our chatbox, we would need to do a lot of manual work to incorporate these as glyphs (and then continue to support them well into the future). \nWe've looked into a few options, but unfortunately they all require a bit more manual labor than we have at the moment.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
